## 9. Integration with Delta Lake Features

### 9.1 Time Travel
Liquid Clustering is fully compatible. Historical snapshots retain their original layout.

```sql
SELECT * FROM sales_data VERSION AS OF 5 WHERE customer_id = 'C123';
-- Data skipping still works on historical versions
```

### 9.2 MERGE (Upsert)
MERGE marks affected files as unclustered. Next `OPTIMIZE` reclusters them.

```sql
MERGE INTO sales_data AS target
USING updates AS source
ON target.transaction_id = source.transaction_id
WHEN MATCHED THEN UPDATE SET *
WHEN NOT MATCHED THEN INSERT *;

-- After merge, run OPTIMIZE to recluster affected files
OPTIMIZE sales_data;
```

### 9.3 Deletion Vectors
Liquid Clustering works with deletion vectors (soft deletes), further reducing write amplification.

### 9.4 Predictive Optimization (Databricks)
On Databricks, **Predictive Optimization** automatically determines when to run OPTIMIZE based on table activity — no manual scheduling needed at all.

```sql
ALTER TABLE sales_data
SET TBLPROPERTIES ('delta.predictiveOptimization' = 'enable');
```

