## 10. Limitations & Gotchas

| Limitation | Notes |
|---|---|
| **Max 4 clustering columns** | Choose carefully; more columns = diminishing returns |
| **No partition pruning via folder** | Tools expecting physical folder partitions won't work |
| **DBR 13.3+ required** | Not available in older runtimes |
| **Delta Lake only** | Not available for Parquet, ORC, or Iceberg tables |
| **Clustering is eventually consistent** | New data is unclustered until OPTIMIZE runs |
| **Does not help point lookups on non-clustered columns** | Always cluster on query-critical columns |
| **Photon recommended** | Best performance with Databricks Photon engine |

